assumed integrated in this diff's a/ side, which is the current main tree, not
the 2026-10-17 baseline). Apply as: `patch -p1 --directory=<main> < PACKET-003.diff`
after confirming `git status` on the listed files. Everything else in R04 is
Archxy 2-owned and ships wholesale (no diff here):

- `rust/crates/domain/src/erp/{organizations,proposals,projects}.rs` — the pure
  contract ports (serde-only, wasm-clean), `erp/mod.rs` gains three `pub mod`
  lines. 50/50 `cargo test -p archava-domain`.
