  mutations ported statement-for-statement from
  `packages/{organizations,proposals,projects}-pg/src/repository.ts`;
  `erp/mod.rs` gains three `pub mod` lines. 24 `cargo test -p archava-adapters`.
- `rust/crates/host/src/erp/{organizations,proposals,projects}.rs` + `mod.rs` —
  gate modules (`ErpGateError`, per-ledger descriptor + opener via
  `r04_opener!`, six routes mounting `/erp/{organizations,proposals,projects}/
  commands{,/status}`) and status handlers.
- `rust/crates/host/tests/erp_{organizations,proposals,projects}.rs` — the
  three witness suites, 9/9 each (27/27), TMPDIR-backed fixture.
- `tools/rust/erp/verify-r04.mjs` — the P-ERP-R04 producer (new file).
- `tools/rust/erp/module-consumers.ts` + `module-consumers.witnesses.mjs` — the
  R04 ledgers join the two-consumer battery scope (10 ERP modules hashed;
  each consumer's verify battery exercises ALL of them from tarballs).
- `examples/rust-consumers/erp/{hospitality,professional-services}/` — deps,
  browser mounts (`mountOrganizationDashboard` for both +
  `mountProjectDashboard`/`mountProposalsDashboard` respectively), typed
  `server-contract.ts` exports, R04 battery sections.
- `docs/rust/archxy2/**` — the working trio (this packet's prose).

